{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1543142-if-you-tasked-with-writing-the-w5-is-fake-supplement-how-would-you-do-it","id":1543142,"title":"If you tasked with writing \"The W5 is Fake\" supplement how would you do it?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Werewolf: The Apocalypse"],"posts":[{"date":"2024-10-05T02:34:51-07:00","id":1543142,"title":"<img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/icons/icon5.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" alt=\"\" /> If you tasked with writing \"The W5 is Fake\" supplement how would you do it?","content":"As the title state if by some contrived series of events all of the W5 writing and management team was promptly ejected and you the good citizens of this forum is drafted in as a replacement. You're first task is to write a supplement that defectively proves that all past material of the line is fake, non caonon, Bu\u00a3%^ht, Absolutely Black Handed. You're given absolutely creative freedom for this task. Now how would you do it?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":25848,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25848-mrornx","user":"MrornX","date":". 10-05-2024, 05:38 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25848-mrornx","name":"MrornX","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"418"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-05T10:41:22-07:00","id":1543152,"title":"","content":"A completely normal player's guide that actually updates the material that was an inherent part of the game. Gnosis gets ported over along with Rage as Essence checks, Rage gets its Celerity-like edge back, Harano and Hauglosk are distant possibilities instead of degeneration tracks (though a Stress track for Darkest Dungeon-like situations would be doable), Gifts are returned to their power level, all the tribes have an emphasis on what corner of war they specialize in as well as history with bits of the world (expansive; like the Shadow Lords, there are branches that stretch across different regions of the world). The Get of Fenris are introduced as causing a lot of mass disappearances among Norse reconstructionist pagans (introduce the Aesir hate early), almost always followed up by unidentifiable bodies showing up that can only be presumed to be the missing individuals in question. Anyone testing for DNA got fouled up by the sheer, vast quantity of concentrated ammonia that soaked everything.<br /> <br /> One of the Flaws is Twisted Upbringing. It mentions, off-hand, the material in the core book as one example of what being taught the wrong way about Garou culture is like. That's it; that's all it gets out of the future word count.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","name":"Saur Ops Specialist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-05T13:20:19-07:00","id":1543158,"title":"","content":"I didn't get the Norse reconstructionist pagans, or am sure that I like it.<br /> <br /> But since this topic is out: I wouldn't do this. I would present W5 as another setting, simply.<br /> <br /> Regardless of how much I dislike W5, I won\u2019t piss on the fun of others. There are people who like it, in the event of me writing for it I would try to improve their game. For legacy I would just write for W20, maybe launch a W30. Sure, making a parody game about W5 would be another thing entirely, but not this.<br /> <br /> Even when I discuss W5, the point is discussing W5. I\u2019ve already lost interest in WtE because it seems to simply exist to piss on W5 instead of being its own thing.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>#NothingAboutUsWithoutUs<br /> #AutismPride<br /> She/her pronouns","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5826-monteparnas","name":"monteparnas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5826_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6710"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-05T14:37:37-07:00","id":1543162,"title":"","content":"I would rebrand W5 as &quot;Werewolf Legends&quot; and then do W6, which is mostly a novel about a werewolf who is totally not my idealized self-insert character with some basic rules thrown in. Then I would keep announcing all of these future sourcebooks written by hot new RPG writers which never seem to actually materialize.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>What is tolerance? It is the consequence of humanity. We are all formed of frailty and error; let us pardon reciprocally each other's folly. That is the first law of nature.</i><br /> Voltaire, &quot;Tolerance&quot; (1764)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\ude02","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12890-no-one-of-consequence","name":"No One of Consequence","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12890_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3937"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-05T19:02:37-07:00","id":1543177,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>monteparnas</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1543142-if-you-tasked-with-writing-the-w5-is-fake-supplement-how-would-you-do-it?p=1543158#post1543158\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I didn't get the Norse reconstructionist pagans, or am sure that I like it.</div> </div> </div> </div>The Get of Fenris as of Revised despise the Aesir, and on the second count, communities of reconstructionist pagans have an unfortunate tendency to be lousy with white supremacists, i.e. the Get would be continuing to pursue the remnants of the Swords of Heimdall and their descendants even decades after the purges got rid of the primary offenders. It can easily paint the Fenrir as being extremist and harsh - they're holding a very, very old grudge, here against even some humans - without following the expectations that people might have about them.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","name":"Saur Ops Specialist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-10-05T21:26:34-07:00","id":1543183,"title":"","content":"Got it. That seems ok to me.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>#NothingAboutUsWithoutUs<br /> #AutismPride<br /> She/her pronouns","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxp